# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# MultiSTARCOP/varon evaluation computes these Varon ratio-band features
# on the fly (src/evaluation/dataset_wiring.py -> feature_extration.
# extract_features) and writes them directly into data/starcop_raw/, a
# DVC-tracked directory -- not tracked content, regenerated every varon
# run. Without this, `dvc pull` refuses with "Can't remove the following
# unsaved files without confirmation" once a varon eval has run at least
# once (track-a-paper-benchmark-reproduction-plan.md Phase 4, hit for real
# by flows/eval_baseline.py's pull_dataset task on 2026-08-22).
data/starcop_raw/**/ratio_wv3_*.tif

# Byproduct of the earlier STARCOP_mini baseline-validation notebook run
# (notebooks/starcop_baseline_validation.py), same "computed output sitting
# in a DVC-tracked directory" issue.
data/processed/starcop_mini/**/weight_mag1c.tif
